<title>CROATIA: Croatia May c/a deficit narrows to $88.7 mln.</title>
<headline>Croatia May c/a deficit narrows to $88.7 mln.</headline>
<dateline>ZAGREB 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Croatia issued the following economic indicator details.</p>
<p> CROATIA CURRENT ACCOUNT	 MAY    APRIL   JAN-MAY   MAY '95</p>
<p> Current account (million USD) -88.7   -169.9   -496.6     -119</p>
<p> Goods			    -203.8   -314.7 -1,098.2     -212</p>
<p> Services			   50.9    110.2    303.4	 59</p>
<p> Income			     -2.9    -27.9    -64.2	-12</p>
<p> Current transfers		67.1     62.5    362.3	 45</p>
<p>-- Kolumbina Bencevic, Zagreb Newsroom, 385-1-4557075</p>
